Cantonese Help, learning Cantonese lovers and users are worth having APP. Free anyway, why not try to download!

The software provides a Function:
1, Cantonese and phonetic pronunciation translation queries (human voice);
2, Cantonese pinyin exercises (consonants, vowels and tones);
3, Commonly used in Cantonese 100 words and sentences;
4, Cantonese common words;
5, Cantonese common situational dialogues;
6, Selection of Cantonese songs (up to the most classic Cantonese songs);
7, Cantonese podcast channels (radio station you want to hear both here).
